Set the active assignee for the current session.

Examples:
  # Set active assignee
  paso assignee set -n "john"

  # JSON output
  paso assignee set -n "john" -j

  # Quiet mode
  paso assignee set -n "john" -q

Usage:
  paso assignee set [flags]

Flags:
  -j, --json          Output in JSON format
  -n, --name string   Assignee name (required)
  -q, --quiet         Minimal output
